atar/a941f83ac4192740c2e1f95676ce23c5?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1499704166, "last_modified": 1787729897, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "charlie21", "last_touched": 1787934589, "title": "码农匹配不上白月光吗", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1237845", "created": 1787893580, "deleted": 0, "content": "码农里面有不少大佬搞钱是非常厉害的，似乎总缺少一种匹配白月光的气质\r\n\r\n很多体育、娱乐明星论财富数量应该赶不上一些码农，但是有一些码农缺少的吸引白月光的气质\r\n\r\n最后都弄得两败俱伤\r\n\r\n别的圈子里面闹掰大部分能体面，像李某某、孙某某这搞的不体面啊\r\n\r\n没有大佬那么多金，小码农深深的忧伤了", "content_rendered": "码农里面有不少大佬搞钱是非常厉害的，似乎总缺少一种匹配白月光的气质<br /><br />很多体育、娱乐明星论财富数量应该赶不上一些码农，但是有一些码农缺少的吸引白月光的气质<br /><br />最后都弄得两败俱伤<br /><br />别的圈子里面闹掰大部分能体面，像李某某、孙某某这搞的不体面啊<br /><br />没有大佬那么多金，小码农深深的忧伤了", "last_modified": 1787893580, "replies": 66, "id": 1237845}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "/static/img/node_default_large.png", "name": "pronunciation", "avatar_normal": "/static/img/node_default_normal.png", "title": "发音", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/pronunciation", "topics": 145, "footer": "", "header": "I'm sorry, I don't speak English.", "title_alternative": "", "avatar_mini": "/static/img/node_default_mini.png", "stars": 32, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 859, "parent_node_name": ""}, "member": {"id": 124931, "username": "shadowyue", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/shadowyue", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f6ae/0e20/124931_mini.png?m=1786430514", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f6ae/0e20/124931_normal.png?m=1786430514", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f6ae/0e20/124931_large.png?m=1786430514", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f6ae/0e20/124931_xlarge.png?m=1786430514", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f6ae/0e20/124931_xxlarge.png?m=1786430514", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f6ae/0e20/124931_xxxlarge.png?m=1786430514", "created": 1435657166, "last_modified": 1786430514, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "HappyAndSmile", "last_touched": 1787927238, "title": "你们怎么念的？ code~x 还是 co~dex", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1237866", "created": 1787898664, "deleted": 0, "content": "刚刚听到别人念 co~dex ，差点没反应过来🫪 正确读音是啥", "content_rendered": "<p>刚刚听到别人念 co~dex ，差点没反应过来🫪 正确读音是啥</p>\n", "last_modified": 1787900412, "replies": 63, "id": 1237866}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6353/8fe6/519_large.png?m=1595507885", "name": "ideas", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6353/8fe6/519_normal.png?m=1595507885", "title": "奇思妙想", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/ideas", "topics": 6598, "footer": "", "header": "让你的创意在这里自由流动吧。", "title_alternative": "Ideas", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6353/8fe6/519_mini.png?m=1595507885", "stars": 3252, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 519, "parent_node_name": "v2ex"}, "member": {"id": 209998, "username": "hnbcinfo", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/hnbcinfo", "website": "", "twitter": "", "psn": "", "github": "", "btc": "1NMd7eML3wePg5qzcxae87tiXzsnwj3myZ", "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7631/1c3a/209998_mini.png?m=1782270981", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7631/1c3a/209998_normal.png?m=1782270981", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7631/1c3a/209998_large.png?m=1782270981", "created": 1484014571, "last_modified": 1782270981, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "zzutmebwd", "last_touched": 1787921980, "title": "买个 B200 或 B300，部署 Deepseek-V4 等开源模型，然后卖服务给大厂，有得赚吗。", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1237864", "created": 1787897879, "deleted": 0, "content": "当然个人基本没戏，我说的是企业去做。\r\n\r\n基于以下事实：\r\n\r\n1. 当前环境下，英伟达高端显卡不允许进入国内市场，受政策影响，腾讯、华为、深度求索这些大厂，即使有渠道购买大概率也不能明目张胆使用。\r\n2. 算力需求，字节、腾讯、华为、阿里、深度求索等都有自己的模型市场，算力需求极大，但国产 GPU 性能、稳定性和运维性价比上，明显不占优势。\r\n3. 小公司受政策影响较小，使用英伟达高端显卡基本不会有啥问题。\r\n4. 模型搭建技术要求低，除了硬件投入，软件和运维成本不高。而且对外只需提供一个调用接口即可，只需要保证接口稳定性和成功率即可。\r\n\r\n基于上面的情况，中小企业能否花几百万自己找渠道买 B200 或 B300 ，然后自己搭建 Deepseek 模型，通过接口租赁给大厂，为了网络稳定可以找机房托管。\r\n然后对接大厂，签合同卖服务使用权或卖 token 。\r\n\r\n\r\n有没有大佬分析下，这种方案，多久能回本，这个玩法是否可行？", "content_rendered": "<p>当然个人基本没戏，我说的是企业去做。</p>\n<p>基于以下事实：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>当前环境下，英伟达高端显卡不允许进入国内市场，受政策影响，腾讯、华为、深度求索这些大厂，即使有渠道购买大概率也不能明目张胆使用。</li>\n<li>算力需求，字节、腾讯、华为、阿里、深度求索等都有自己的模型市场，算力需求极大，但国产 GPU 性能、稳定性和运维性价比上，明显不占优势。</li>\n<li>小公司受政策影响较小，使用英伟达高端显卡基本不会有啥问题。</li>\n<li>模型搭建技术要求低，除了硬件投入，软件和运维成本不高。而且对外只需提供一个调用接口即可，只需要保证接口稳定性和成功率即可。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>基于上面的情况，中小企业能否花几百万自己找渠道买 B200 或 B300 ，然后自己搭建 Deepseek 模型，通过接口租赁给大厂，为了网络稳定可以找机房托管。\n然后对接大厂，签合同卖服务使用权或卖 token 。</p>\n<p>有没有大佬分析下，这种方案，多久能回本，这个玩法是否可行？</p>\n", "last_modified": 1787897879, "replies": 47, "id": 1237864}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c74d/97b0/16_large.png?m=1727584731", "name": "share", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c74d/97b0/16_normal.png?m=1727584731", "title": "分享发现", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/share", "topics": 47068, "footer": "", "header": "分享你看到的好玩的，有信息量的，欢迎从这里获取灵感。", "title_alternative": "Share", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c74d/97b0/16_mini.png?m=1727584731", "stars": 6346, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 16, "parent_node_name": "v2ex"}, "member": {"id": 813760, "username": "mytokens", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/mytokens", "website": "https://api.mytokens.pro", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "https://api.mytokens.pro", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9b06/45b6/813760_mini.png?m=1787890701", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9b06/45b6/813760_normal.png?m=1787890701", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9b06/45b6/813760_large.png?m=1787890701", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9b06/45b6/813760_xlarge.png?m=1787890701", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9b06/45b6/813760_xxlarge.png?m=1787890701", "created": 1779158384, "last_modified": 1787890701, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "xuanbg", "last_touched": 1787887818, "ti