不推）</p>\n<p>另有不限量几块钱就能造一天的 luna</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BKDmPRL.png\"/></p>\n", "last_modified": 1787929594, "replies": 39, "id": 1237979}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4ea0/6fbc/770_large.png?m=1768280127", "name": "career", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4ea0/6fbc/770_normal.png?m=1768280127", "title": "职场话题", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/career", "topics": 24198, "footer": "", "header": "这里，我们聊聊那些工作中遇到的开心和不开心的事。", "title_alternative": "Career", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4ea0/6fbc/770_mini.png?m=1768280127", "stars": 3732, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 770, "parent_node_name": ""}, "member": {"id": 435394, "username": "michaelxuan", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/michaelxuan", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5d5f/a2a4/435394_mini.png?m=1787884885", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5d5f/a2a4/435394_normal.png?m=1787884885", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5d5f/a2a4/435394_large.png?m=1787884885", "created": 1565589473, "last_modified": 1787884885, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "zzutmebwd", "last_touched": 1787873503, "title": "原来真的有人认为工作年限应该与薪资挂钩，各位 v 友怎么看", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1237806", "created": 1787885629, "deleted": 0, "content": "笔者上个星期去技术面试，与面试官交谈的时候。第一句问我薪资期望多少 我说 12k  然后说你薪资要的太低了。然后给我科普了 普通本科 10 年 5 年 3 年应该拿多少钱？如果不足就是能力不行。。其他的也没多问。然后就 balabala 说了一大堆。说我不够热情。话里话外的意思就是不管市场如何，你值多少钱就是多少钱？ 关键是他们招聘写的 10k-15k...... 真能给到 15k 吗？ \r\n\r\n笔者一直觉得你能拿高于全社会工资水平的溢价部分其实是市场给的，跟你本身没多大关系。比如以前的房地产从业人员和现在的人员比有区别吗？行业下行 你的价值就贬值了。。。", "content_rendered": "<p>笔者上个星期去技术面试，与面试官交谈的时候。第一句问我薪资期望多少 我说 12k  然后说你薪资要的太低了。然后给我科普了 普通本科 10 年 5 年 3 年应该拿多少钱？如果不足就是能力不行。。其他的也没多问。然后就 balabala 说了一大堆。说我不够热情。话里话外的意思就是不管市场如何，你值多少钱就是多少钱？ 关键是他们招聘写的 10k-15k...... 真能给到 15k 吗？ </p>\n<p>笔者一直觉得你能拿高于全社会工资水平的溢价部分其实是市场给的，跟你本身没多大关系。比如以前的房地产从业人员和现在的人员比有区别吗？行业下行 你的价值就贬值了。。。</p>\n", "last_modified": 1787885629, "replies": 38, "id": 1237806}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_large.png?m=1777132346", "name": "qna", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_normal.png?m=1777132346", "title": "问与答", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/qna", "topics": 241152, "footer": "", "header": "<!--\r\n一个更好的世界需要你持续地提出好问题。\r\n-->", "title_alternative": "Questions and Answers", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_mini.png?m=1777132346", "stars": 4511, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 12, "parent_node_name": "v2ex"}, "member": {"id": 102175, "username": "rrubick", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/rrubick", "website": "", "twitter": "", "psn": "", "github": "", "btc": "", "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9bee/a327/102175_mini.png?m=1778467100", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9bee/a327/102175_normal.png?m=1778467100", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9bee/a327/102175_large.png?m=1778467100", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9bee/a327/102175_xlarge.png?m=1778467100", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9bee/a327/102175_xxlarge.png?m=1778467100", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9bee/a327/102175_xxxlarge.png?m=1778467100", "created": 1425387702, "last_modified": 1778467100, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "eventlooped", "last_touched": 1787968944, "title": "一个人周末有哪些消遣娱乐活动", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1237914", "created": 1787906092, "deleted": 0, "content": "除了做饭吃饭不想一个人呆在家。\r\n胡子刮破了没办法去游泳，之前在外面打王者现在也已经卸载。", "content_rendered": "除了做饭吃饭不想一个人呆在家。<br />胡子刮破了没办法去游泳，之前在外面打王者现在也已经卸载。", "last_modified": 1787906092, "replies": 38, "id": 1237914}]